if {squirrelKey} == false:
	A library with a couple of acorns stored within the shelves.
	Call out?
	- Yes
		audio "res://sound/sfx/wormcall.wav"
		[wait time="2.0"]
		...
		unknown: Oh! Hello!
		unknown: I would open the library, but I’m not confident it’s the right moment.
		unknown: I don’t like making decisions without all the information.
		if {mouseOpen} == true:
		- It’s okay if it’s not perfect.
			unknown: I appreciate the sentiment, but that doesn’t reduce uncertainty.
		- People are waiting. You should open.
			unknown: Pressure introduces error.
		- What detail are you missing?
			unknown: I’m trying to decide the optimal open hours so I'm not wasting my time…
			unknown: ..but I don’t know when people usually stop by.
			- I can find out for you!
				unknown: That'd be so helpful. Thank you.
				set {squirrelKey} = true
			- Isn't your indecision wasting more time?
				unknown: Hardly! I can be saving hundreds of hours!
	- No
else:
	unknown: Oh Hello again! Have you… learned anything?
	- Seems like Bunny and Mouse both agree that swinging by the library is best after a nice lunch. | [if {squirrelKey2} == true and {squirrelKey3} == true] [else="hide"]
		unknown: That makes sense! A full stomach is certainly an indicator for better focus!
		unknown: Yes! That reduces uncertainty significantly.
		unknown: Looks like now is a good time to open then!
		set {squirrelOpen} = true
		set {squirrelKey4} = true
		set {squirrelKey5} = true
	- Seems like Mouse enjoys sitting to read a good book after lunch | [if {squirrelKey2} == true and {squirrelKey3} == false] [else="hide"]
		unknown: Intersting... but can you get some more data?
	- Seems like Bunny enjoys sitting to read a good book after lunch | [if {squirrelKey2} == false and {squirrelKey3} == true]
		unknown: Intersting... but can you get some more data?
	- Seems like Hedgehog opens when it feels right | [if {squirrelKey5} == true]
		unknown: Hedgehog was very kind…
		..but that didn’t reduce uncertainty at all.
	- People will show up eventually.
		unknown: That lacks sufficient data.
	- I think you should open now.
		unknown: Thanks but I can't rely on just a single data point.

[signal arg="dialogue_end"]